            <p style={{ alignSelf: "stretch", fontSize: "16px", lineHeight: "24px", fontWeight: 400, color: "#475569" }}>{`To design an experience that truly helps people take care of plants, I studied user behavior and motivations through interviews and observation of usage scenarios in similar applications`}</p>
